<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hills profit rises, special div.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hills profit rises, special div.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    13.13 vs 11.88</p>
<p>    Net					7.45 vs 6.59</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     3.1  vs 2.4</p>
<p>NOTE: Special div 2.0 cents to mark company's 50th anniversary is 39 percent franked. Hills Industries Ltd is a maker of metal products and electronics equipment.  </p>
<p>    Sales				 170.25 vs 177.57</p>
<p>    Other income			  2.29 vs 2.42</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    7.0 vs 6.3</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 nil vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 21</p>
<p>Reg date April 7</p>
<p>    Tax				     5.03 vs 4.54</p>
<p>    Interest				1.37 vs 1.72</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  4.01 vs 4.06</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
